---
interface Props {
  kind: "orchestrator" | "ownership" | "recovery";
}

const { kind } = Astro.props;
const titleId = `concept-figure-${kind}`;
---

{
  kind === "orchestrator" && (
    <figure class="concept-figure" aria-labelledby={titleId}>
      <header class="concept-figure__header">
        <p class="concept-figure__index">01 / Existing system</p>
        <h3 id={titleId}>The existing multi-agent orchestrator</h3>
      </header>

      <div class="orchestrator-map" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="orchestrator-map__stage">
          <span class="concept-figure__eyebrow">Describe</span>
          <strong>Formula</strong>
          <small>steps + dependencies</small>
        </div>
        <span class="concept-figure__arrow">→</span>
        <div class="orchestrator-map__stage orchestrator-map__ledger">
          <span class="concept-figure__eyebrow">Remember facts</span>
          <strong>Work ledger</strong>
          <small>ready · claimed · complete</small>
        </div>
        <span class="concept-figure__arrow">→</span>
        <div class="orchestrator-map__stage">
          <span class="concept-figure__eyebrow">Route</span>
          <strong>Dispatcher</strong>
          <small>find eligible work</small>
        </div>
        <span class="concept-figure__arrow concept-figure__arrow--fan">⇢</span>
        <div class="orchestrator-map__agents">
          <span>agent session A</span>
          <span>agent session B</span>
          <span>agent session C</span>
        </div>
        <span class="concept-figure__arrow concept-figure__arrow--join">⇢</span>
        <div class="orchestrator-map__stage">
          <span class="concept-figure__eyebrow">Verify + record</span>
          <strong>Review and receipt</strong>
          <small>artifacts · tests · outcome</small>
        </div>
        <div class="orchestrator-map__repair">
          <span>repair scans</span>
          <span class="orchestrator-map__repair-line"></span>
          <span>infer a missing handoff from surviving facts</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figcaption>
        The ledger preserves task facts. Dispatch, agent sessions, and repair
        loops collectively advance the procedure, so a crash can leave the next
        safe action ambiguous.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  )
}

{
  kind === "ownership" && (
    <figure class="concept-figure" aria-labelledby={titleId}>
      <header class="concept-figure__header">
        <p class="concept-figure__index">02 / New boundary</p>
        <h3 id={titleId}>Who owns what after the move</h3>
      </header>

      <div class="ownership-map">
        <section>
          <div class="ownership-map__owner">
            <span class="concept-figure__eyebrow">Application record</span>
            <strong>Work ledger</strong>
          </div>
          <p>Mutable task facts, claims, dependencies, artifacts, and outcomes</p>
          <ul aria-label="Work ledger examples">
            <li>ready</li>
            <li>generation</li>
            <li>receipt</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="ownership-map__temporal">
          <div class="ownership-map__owner">
            <span class="concept-figure__eyebrow">Durable procedure</span>
            <strong>Temporal Workflow</strong>
          </div>
          <p>Deterministic decisions, waits, retries, cancellation, and progress</p>
          <ul aria-label="Temporal Workflow examples">
            <li>Event History</li>
            <li>timers</li>
            <li>signals</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
          <div class="ownership-map__owner">
            <span class="concept-figure__eyebrow">Nondeterministic work</span>
            <strong>Temporal Activities</strong>
          </div>
          <p>Ledger I/O, agent processes, tests, reviews, and external calls</p>
          <ul aria-label="Temporal Activity examples">
            <li>heartbeat</li>
            <li>fence</li>
            <li>idempotency</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>

      <p class="ownership-map__service">
        <span>Temporal service</span>
        persists Workflow Event History and coordinates Task Queues. Workers can
        disappear without taking the recorded procedure with them.
      </p>

      <figcaption>
        The work ledger remains the source for task facts. Temporal gives the
        procedure a durable owner and routes side effects through retryable
        Activities.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  )
}

{
  kind === "recovery" && (
    <figure class="concept-figure" aria-labelledby={titleId}>
      <header class="concept-figure__header">
        <p class="concept-figure__index">03 / Recovery invariant</p>
        <h3 id={titleId}>One agent session survives Worker loss</h3>
      </header>

      <div class="recovery-map">
        <ol class="recovery-map__events">
          <li>
            <span class="recovery-map__number">1</span>
            <strong>Worker A schedules the Activity</strong>
            <small>stable Activity ID + claim token</small>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="recovery-map__number">2</span>
            <strong>The Activity binds an agent</strong>
            <small>progress is heartbeated</small>
          </li>
          <li class="recovery-map__failure">
            <span class="recovery-map__number">×</span>
            <strong>Worker A dies</strong>
            <small>the agent session keeps running</small>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="recovery-map__number">3</span>
            <strong>Worker B resumes</strong>
            <small>replay + heartbeat recovery</small>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="recovery-map__number">4</span>
            <strong>The retry reattaches</strong>
            <small>one fenced terminal receipt</small>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="recovery-map__session" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>one session</span>
          <i></i>
          <span>one generation</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figcaption>
        Workflow replay recovers orchestration state. The application’s
        start-or-attach protocol and generation fence keep Activity retry from
        creating a second agent or accepting a stale result.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  )
}

<style>
  .concept-figure {
    --figure-rule: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 22%, transparent);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 68rem;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: clamp(var(--space-xl), 7vw, var(--space-3xl)) auto;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .concept-figure__header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 0.55fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    padding-block-end: var(--space-s);
    align-items: end;
    gap: var(--space-l);
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--figure-rule);
  }

  .concept-figure__header p,
  .concept-figure__header h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .concept-figure__header h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
  }

  .concept-figure__index,
  .concept-figure__eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .concept-figure__eyebrow {
    display: block;
    margin-block-end: 0.2rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .concept-figure figcaption {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-s);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  .orchestrator-map {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns:
      minmax(0, 0.8fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 0.8fr) auto
      minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    min-width: 0;
    padding-block: var(--space-l);
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .orchestrator-map__stage {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .orchestrator-map__stage strong,
  .orchestrator-map__agents span {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
  }

  .orchestrator-map__stage small {
    display: block;
    margin-block-start: 0.3rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
  }

  .orchestrator-map__ledger {
    padding: var(--space-s);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 7%, var(--color-bg));
  }

  .orchestrator-map__agents {
    display: grid;
    min-width: 0;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .orchestrator-map__agents span {
    padding-block: 0.35rem;
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--figure-rule);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .concept-figure__arrow {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .concept-figure__arrow--fan,
  .concept-figure__arrow--join {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .orchestrator-map__repair {
    display: grid;
    grid-column: 2 / 9;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(2rem, 1fr) minmax(0, auto);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-s);
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-s);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .orchestrator-map__repair-line {
    border-block-start: 1px dashed var(--color-accent);
  }

  .ownership-map {
    min-width: 0;
    margin-block: var(--space-m) 0;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--figure-rule);
  }

  .ownership-map section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(12rem, 1fr);
    min-width: 0;
    padding-block: var(--space-m);
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-l);
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--figure-rule);
  }

  .ownership-map section:last-child {
    border-block-end: 0;
  }

  .ownership-map__temporal {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 7%, var(--color-bg));
  }

  .ownership-map__owner {
    padding-inline-start: var(--space-s);
  }

  .ownership-map__owner strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
  }

  .ownership-map p,
  .ownership-map ul {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ownership-map p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  .ownership-map ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 0;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .ownership-map li {
    padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--figure-rule);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .ownership-map__service {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 2.5fr);
    margin: 0;
    padding: var(--space-s);
    gap: var(--space-l);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--figure-rule);
  }

  .ownership-map__service span {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .recovery-map {
    min-width: 0;
    padding-block: var(--space-l) var(--space-m);
  }

  .recovery-map__events {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    gap: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .recovery-map__events li {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 2.2rem var(--space-s) var(--space-s);
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--figure-rule);
  }

  .recovery-map__events li::after {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -0.28rem calc(-0.28rem - 1px) auto auto;
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--color-text-muted);
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 50%, 0 100%);
    content: "";
  }

  .recovery-map__events li:last-child::after {
    display: none;
  }

  .recovery-map__number {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -0.8rem auto auto var(--space-s);
    display: grid;
    width: 1.55rem;
    height: 1.55rem;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .recovery-map__events strong,
  .recovery-map__events small {
    display: block;
  }

  .recovery-map__events strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
  }

  .recovery-map__events small {
    margin-block-start: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
  }

  .recovery-map__failure {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 8%, var(--color-bg));
  }

  .recovery-map__failure .recovery-map__number {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .recovery-map__session {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(2rem, 1fr) auto;
    padding: var(--space-s);
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-s);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .recovery-map__session i {
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .orchestrator-map {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .orchestrator-map__agents,
    .orchestrator-map__stage {
      min-height: 5.5rem;
    }

    .orchestrator-map > :nth-child(7) {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 3;
    }

    .orchestrator-map > :nth-child(8) {
      grid-column: 2;
      grid-row: 3;
    }

    .orchestrator-map > :nth-child(9) {
      grid-column: 3;
      grid-row: 3;
    }

    .orchestrator-map__repair {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .concept-figure__header {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-xs);
    }

    .orchestrator-map {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      padding-block: var(--space-m);
    }

    .orchestrator-map__stage,
    .orchestrator-map__agents {
      min-height: 0;
    }

    .orchestrator-map > :nth-child(n) {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: auto;
    }

    .concept-figure__arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      justify-self: start;
    }

    .orchestrator-map__repair {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      margin-block-start: var(--space-m);
      padding-block-start: var(--space-s);
      border-block-start: 1px dashed var(--color-accent);
    }

    .orchestrator-map__repair-line {
      display: none;
    }

    .ownership-map section,
    .ownership-map__service {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: var(--space-m) var(--space-s);
      gap: var(--space-xs);
    }

    .ownership-map__owner {
      padding-inline-start: 0;
    }

    .recovery-map__events {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding-inline-start: 0.8rem;
    }

    .recovery-map__events li {
      padding: var(--space-s) var(--space-s) var(--space-m) 2.4rem;
      border-block-start: 0;
      border-inline-start: 1px solid var(--figure-rule);
    }

    .recovery-map__events li::after {
      inset: auto auto -0.25rem -0.28rem;
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }

    .recovery-map__number {
      inset: var(--space-s) auto auto -0.8rem;
    }

    .recovery-map__session {
      padding-inline: 2.4rem var(--space-s);
    }
  }
</style>
